# Alive check (lane forestv2): the PAUSE menu only opens in gameplay, and its SHOW OBJECTIVE makes Red Alert speak the
# objective (an audio cue streamed from /SOUND/ENGLISH/AUDIOCUE/*, LSN 1127430-1146821, ~13 vs after the press). On the
# STASIS LOCK / ENERGON DEPLETED menu START does nothing and down + cross pick CONTINUE / RETURN TO HQ / QUIT GAME: no cue
# -> the wait times out -> RESULT FAIL step 'alive_check'. So a run where Optimus died FAILS instead of passing.
          mark fv2_end
alive_check: press start
          wait pads 30 timeout 3000vs
          press down
          wait pads 20 timeout 3000vs
          press cross
          wait lsn 1127430-1146821 timeout 240vs
          mark alive_objective
          pass forest v2 finished with Optimus alive (objective speech heard)
